OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force introduces new facial
OL,4,Arecognition vans
OL,5,
OL,6,FHertfordshire Police has introduced two
OL,7,Fnew dedicated vehicles to increase its
OL,8,Fuse of facial recognition technology.
OL,10,FThe force first trialled the technology
OL,11,Fin Cheshunt last December and has since
OL,12,Fdeployed it at locations across the
OL,13,Fcounty.
OL,15,FLive Facial Recognition (LFR) uses
OL,16,Fcameras to compare people's faces with
OL,17,Fpre-authorised watchlists of
OL,18,Findividuals wanted by police and
OL,19,Fofficers are sent an alert once a
OL,20,Fpotential match is identified.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
