OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force introduces new facial
OL,4,Arecognition vans
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Supt Nev Hanks said: "Having two
OL,7,Fdedicated LFR vans gives Hertfordshire
OL,8,FConstabulary greater flexibility to use
OL,9,Fthe technology across the county,
OL,10,Fsupporting our efforts to identify
OL,11,Fwanted individuals, prevent crime and
OL,12,Fprotect the public."
